flowchart TD
  Need[Design review?] --> Q1{Does the design expose data, identity, or availability risk?}
  Q1 -->|Yes first| Trusted[Score Trusted: secure, compliant, reliable]
  Q1 -->|No acute risk| Q2{Can the owning admin or team maintain it?}
  Q2 -->|No| EasyFail[Fails Easy even if it compiles]
  Q2 -->|Yes| Q3{Can this change next quarter without a rewrite?}
  Q3 -->|No| AdaptFail[Fails Adaptable: not composable or resilient]
  Q3 -->|Yes| Pass[Defend all three compasses in the review]
